# MSVC build artifacts. The DLL itself (talq_wgc.dll) IS committed as a
# deployment dependency (build-release.sh / deploy-dev.sh copy it beside
# talq.exe), the same way third_party/onnxruntime/bin/onnxruntime.dll is
# vendored. When you change the WGC source, rebuild via build.bat and commit
# the refreshed talq_wgc.dll alongside.
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.exe
wgc_frame.*
